{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin Simulator is a game in which you can become a pumpkin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will give you a meditative gameplay. You can stand and contemplate the beauty of the forest around you living your life as a pumpkin. You can also perform actions that pumpkins usually perform (stand in the same place). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a pumpkin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the forest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other pumpkins around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only pumpkins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game mods: arcade and realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful low poly graphics</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817850/a114bce4576b5a116d8105b3017f1e1d7e1bf95b.jpg"},{"name":"Ordinary Pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817850/248116d75da12f022496b8ab005e8beb322b0df1.jpg"},{"name":"Unusual Pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817850/062ee35b30268177f328a35e6e950503e1957ca2.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817850/1ba2ece53e20846b105d6960a6e9a759ac62287e.jpg"},{"name":"Godlike Pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817850/afcab93f58b4ac8f9aac693cee760cebf449856e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817850?t=1761404419","background_ra